sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Writer W
  participant C as Clustering C
  participant IDX as C.outputIndex
  Note over W,C: A2 - W commits first, then C
  W->>W: update k -> v1 (comp > h_C)
  W->>C: commit to f1 (residual w.r.t. h_C)
  C->>C: finalize detects residuals in input fgs
  C->>IDX: owner = outputIndex(k) route by key, not partitioner
  C->>C: fold k -> v1 into owner fg
  C->>C: replacecommit (folds + replacement, atomic)
  Note over W,C: reader sees pre-C or post-C, never a gap
